#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:1
msgid "Amiga Juggler"
msgstr "Amiga malabarista"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Una recreación en tiempo real de la demostración de Amiga \"Juggler\" de "
"1987 de Eric Graham: un GLSL\n"
"puerto de su trazador de rayos recursivo. El robot, las pelotas, el tablero "
"de ajedrez.\n"
"Los reflejos del suelo y del espejo se generan y se trazan mediante trazado "
"de rayos.\n"
"\n"
"Escrito por Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

