msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Este protector de pantalla se eliminó de la distribución XScreenSaver a "
"partir de\n"
"versión 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"Un autómata celular que en realidad es una máquina de Turing bidimensional:\n"
"A medida que las cabezas (\"hormigas\") caminan por la pantalla, cambian de "
"píxel.\n"
"valores en su camino.  Luego, cuando pasan sobre los píxeles modificados, "
"sus\n"
"el comportamiento se ve influenciado.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Escrito por David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "

