# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/blitspin.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Repeatedly rotates an image by 90 degrees by using bitwise-logical\n"
"operations.\n"
"\n"
"The bitmap is divided into quadrants, and the quadrants are shifted\n"
"clockwise.  Then the same thing is done again with progressively\n"
"smaller quadrants, except that all sub-quadrants of a given size are\n"
"rotated in parallel.  As you watch it, the image appears to dissolve\n"
"into static and then reconstitute itself, but rotated.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 1992.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Gira repetidamente una imagen 90 grados usando lógica bit a bit\n"
"operaciones.\n"
"\n"
"cuadrantes más pequeños, excepto que todos los subcuadrantes de un tamaño "
"determinado son\n"
"gira en paralelo.  El mapa de bits se divide en cuadrantes y los cuadrantes "
"se desplazan\n"
"Mientras lo miras, la imagen parece disolverse.\n"
"en el sentido de las agujas del reloj.  en estático y luego reconstituirse, "
"pero rotado.Luego se vuelve a hacer lo mismo progresivamente\n"
"\n"
"Escrito por Jamie Zawinski; 1992.\n"
"  "

