msgstr "Esper"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\"Enhance 224 to 176. Pull out track right. Center in pull back.  Pull\n"
"back. Wait a minute. Go right. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Track 45 left.\n"
"Gimme a hardcopy right there.\"\n"
"\n"
"The Esper Machine was a voice-controlled forensic device used by LAPD\n"
"in 2019, as documented in the 1982 film, Blade Runner.  It was capable\n"
"of enhancing photographs to an extreme degree, including reconstructing\n"
"different viewpoints within the space from the reflections on various\n"
"objects in the photograph.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"Mejorar 224 a 176. Sacar el riel hacia la derecha. Centrar en tirar hacia "
"atrás. Tirar\n"
"atrás. Espera un minuto. Ve a la derecha. Detente. Realce 57 19. Pista 45 "
"izquierda.\n"
"Dame una copia impresa allí mismo.\"\n"
"\n"
"La máquina Esper era un dispositivo forense controlado por voz utilizado por "
"LAPD.\n"
"en 2019, como se documenta en la película de 1982, Blade Runner.  era capaz\n"
"de mejorar fotografías hasta el extremo, incluida la reconstrucción\n"
"diferentes puntos de vista dentro del espacio a partir de las reflexiones "
"sobre diversos\n"
"objetos en la fotografía.\n"
"\n"
"Escrito por Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "

