# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/platonicfolding.xml.h:31
msgid ""
"\n"
"The unfolding and folding of the Platonic solids.\n"
"\n"
"For the five Platonic solids (the tetrahedron, cube, octahedron,\n"
"dodecahedron, and icosahedron), all unfoldings of its faces are\n"
"non-overlapping: they form a net. The tetrahedron has 16 unfoldings,\n"
"of which two are essentially different (non-isomorphic), the cube and\n"
"octahedron each have 384 unfoldings, of which eleven are\n"
"non-isomorphic, and the dodecahedron and icosahedron each have\n"
"5,184,000 unfoldings, of which 43,380 are non-isomorphic. This program\n"
"displays randomly selected unfoldings for the five Platonic solids.\n"
"The faces of the Platonic solids are either folded jointly or\n"
"successively. Note that while it is guaranteed that the nets of the\n"
"Platonic solids are non-overlapping, their faces may occasionally\n"
"intersect during the unfolding and folding.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platonic_solid\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Net_(polyhedron)\n"
"\n"
"Written by Carsten Steger; 2025.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"El despliegue y plegamiento de los sólidos platónicos.\n"
"\n"
"El tetraedro tiene 16 despliegues,\n"
"Los sólidos platónicos no se superponen, sus caras pueden ocasionalmente\n"
"este programa\n"
"de los cuales dos son esencialmente diferentes (no isomorfos), el cubo y\n"
"se cruzan durante el despliegue y el plegado.muestra despliegues "
"seleccionados aleatoriamente para los cinco sólidos platónicos.\n"
"Para los cinco sólidos platónicos (el tetraedro, el cubo, el octaedro,\n"
"Las caras de los sólidos platónicos están plegadas conjuntamente o\n"
"octaedro tienen cada uno 384 despliegues, de los cuales once son\n"
"dodecaedro e icosaedro), todos los despliegues de sus caras son\n"
"sucesivamente. no isomorfos, y el dodecaedro y el icosaedro tienen cada uno\n"
"no superpuestos: forman una red. Tenga en cuenta que si bien se garantiza "
"que las redes del\n"
"5.184.000 despliegues, de los cuales 43.380 son no isomorfos.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Platonic_solid\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Net_(poliedro)\n"
"\n"
"Escrito por Carsten Steger; 2025.\n"
"  "

